Third-party material

Datasets are not part of this license. The notebooks download them from their original sources at run
time, and each dataset remains under its own license:

    Wisconsin Diagnostic Breast Cancer (UCI, via scikit-learn)        CC BY 4.0
    UCI Cleveland heart disease                                       CC BY 4.0
    PneumoniaMNIST, MedMNIST v2 (Zenodo)                              CC BY 4.0
    Weinstock et al. (2016) CGM data, as distributed by GlucoBench    CC BY-SA 4.0, as listed by GlucoBench
    PhysioNet/Computing in Cardiology Challenge 2019                  CC BY 4.0
    MIT-BIH Atrial Fibrillation Database (PhysioNet)                  Open Data Commons Attribution 1.0

The example CGM traces stored in docs/lab-data.js are excerpts of the Weinstock et al. data and remain
under CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution to the original study and to GlucoBench.

Third-party software used by the notebooks, the XAI Lab and the dashboard remains under its own license.
